{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n周志康與羅毓儀（Yuki）在TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》中的感情線持續升溫，最新劇情大派福利，兩人連場甜蜜互動閃瞎觀眾！Yuki不但換上青春啦啦隊服大跳可愛舞步，更主動連環獻吻，畫面「糖分超標」！面對劇中如此親密的戲份，已為人夫的周志康就大方分享老婆的真實反應，更笑言可能會被「扭耳仔」！\n</p>\n<h2>羅毓儀啦啦隊Look放閃 周志康慘食地獄料理</h2>\n<p>劇中一幕，Yuki與周志康在睡房內有連場甜蜜互動，Yuki換上青春可愛的啦啦隊服為老公打氣，之後除了被周志康「公主抱」外，她更甜絲絲地連環親吻男方面珠三下，畫面充滿粉紅泡泡。不過甜蜜過後亦有笑料，為配合臥底身份，Yuki在天台與老公談情時，竟化身「地獄廚神」，炮製出「苦瓜釀香蕉」、「豉椒炒橙皮」及「紅肉火龍果炒飯」等暗黑料理款待周志康，到底這些創意菜式背後有何玄機，就要留待觀眾在劇中發掘。</p>\n<h2>周志康爆拍親熱戲獲老婆開綠燈 笑言會被扭耳仔</h2>\n<p>當被問到會否與太太和兩位女兒一同收看這些甜蜜場面時，周志康笑言因近日忙於綵排台慶，相信未能與家人一齊欣賞，但他強調：「不過佢哋都會支持爸爸，睇爸爸嘅演出。」至於將來若有更大膽的親熱戲會否抗拒，他表示作為專業演員，只要劇本好，任何角色都願意嘗試。談到太太的反應，他則笑著大派定心丸：「太太一直好支持我嘅演出，當然唔多唔少都可能會扭吓耳仔，但絕對冇問題嘅。」</p>\n<h2>網民大讚糖分超標：「周志康老婆好大方！」</h2>\n<p>預告一出，網民對兩人的甜蜜互動反應熱烈，同時亦大讚周志康的太太非常大方。網民留言：「錫三下嗰度好sweet！糖分超標啦！」、「苦瓜釀香蕉係咩玩法？笑死！」、「周志康真係好男人，拍親熱戲前先同老婆備案。」、「佢老婆好大方，識得講笑話扭耳仔，好可愛嘅夫妻！」、「專業演員！期待周志康更多唔同嘅演出！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_18779363856afd2de637876.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_18779363856afd2de637876.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_18597808326afd2df686f06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_18597808326afd2df686f06.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_15454085156afd2e0168729.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_15454085156afd2e0168729.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_18271796606afd2e057b5ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_18271796606afd2e057b5ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_14865360676afd2e0e5ab23.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_14865360676afd2e0e5ab23.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_8292267176afd2e13893a8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_8292267176afd2e13893a8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_5141542936afd2e1865094.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_5141542936afd2e1865094.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_19955203076afd2e2275701.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_19955203076afd2e2275701.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:23:58.609489+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1039,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:28.882337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:28.882337+00:00","content_hash":"a0a13492bee048d2bd5a413ea265e9acac562c7b0337f7c191903e6719972a7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}